Tap.

1436
01:02:45.170 --> 01:02:45.590
Nope.

1437
01:02:46.110 --> 01:02:46.390
Spring.

1438
01:02:46.670 --> 01:02:46.970
Nope.

1439
01:02:47.470 --> 01:02:48.170
Purified.

1440
01:02:48.310 --> 01:02:48.910
Yes!

1441
01:02:50.090 --> 01:02:51.230
Purified water!

1442
01:02:51.730 --> 01:02:56.750
The reverse osmosis makes it the most pure above filtered spring or tap.

1443
01:02:57.210 --> 01:02:58.310
