1444
01:02:58.310 --> 01:03:05.170
But Pepsi and Coke were already using purified water as the basis of their sodas.

1445
01:03:05.390 --> 01:03:08.650
So they would get water, they would purify it, and then they would add all the bubbles,

1446
01:03:08.750 --> 01:03:11.770
and then they would add all the other stuff that you put in a soda.

1447
01:03:12.050 --> 01:03:12.310
Yeah.

1448
01:03:12.830 --> 01:03:18.310
And so it was really easy for them to just start bottling it, you know, before they did all

1449
01:03:18.310 --> 01:03:19.710
the rest of it to make it a soda.

